Subject: Re: [stan-users] Extremely slow categorical logit model
Message-ID: <yXUsXOIUlqM.P6fXAOt9CgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <yXUsXOIUlqM.KJluBsB7CgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
