>>>             97.5% n_eff     Rhat
>>> theta[1]     1.70     2   560.20
>>> lp__     -2567.77     2 20217.25
>>>  Here's the Stan
>>>
>>> functions {
>>>   real[] pendulum(real t,
>>>                   real[] y,
>>>                   real[] theta,
>>>                   real[] x_r,
>>>                   int[] x_i) {
>>>     real dydt[2];
>>>     dydt[1] <- y[2];
>>>     dydt[2] <- - theta[1] * sin(y[1]);
>>>     return dydt;
