From u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com  Tue Jan 12 20:18:18 2016
From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Tue, 12 Jan 2016 20:18:18 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Polytomous Item Response Theory
Message-ID: <1ivBLrmdUJs.-fuTOsnZAAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <1ivBLrmdUJs.Eerc5EAoCgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
