I'd suggest taking a closer look at the Stan manual and
some of our examples.  There are a lot of examples of
GLMs of the kind you're trying to fit, both in the manual
and the examples in example-models from the ARM book.

We're happy to help, but don't have time to debug
your code example by example as you learn Stan.

In this case, the problem is that you only define mu[N],
not mu[1], ..., mu[N-1].   Stan can't use what you don't
define.

- Bob

