Subject: (simple) Mixture model - why does not work as classification algorithm?
Message-ID: <mmQ7U3fVQuc.gdFG_VnMAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/mmQ7U3fVQuc/m/gdFG_VnMAgAJ>
